meta {
  name: Update User
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.UserService/UpdateUser
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "id": "{{userId}}",
    "email": "updated@example.com",
    "name": "Jane Smith Updated"
  }
}

docs {
  # Update User

  Updates an existing user's details.

  ## Authentication
  Requires valid access token.

  ## Request
  - `id` (required): The UUID of the user to update
  - `email` (optional): Updated email address
  - `name` (optional): Updated display name

  ## Behavior
  - Only provided fields will be updated
  - Password cannot be updated through this endpoint
  - Use AssignRole to modify user roles

  ## Response
  Returns the updated user.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "user": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "email": "updated@example.com",
      "name": "Jane Smith Updated",
      "roles": [...],
      "createdAt": "2026-03-27T19:00:00+01:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-27T19:05:00+01:00"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: user id is required
  - `NOT_FOUND`: user not found
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to update user
}
